%% model: gemini_3_8_flash
%% prompt: 9. Classifying wildlife camera photographs (prompts.md)
flowchart TD
    Start([Image Upload]) --> CheckCorrupt{Is File Corrupt?}
    CheckCorrupt -- Yes --> Discard[/Quarantine Corrupt File/]
    CheckCorrupt -- No --> PreFilter{Automated Animal Detection}

    PreFilter -- No Animal Detected --> ArchiveEmpty[(Empty Image Archive)]
    PreFilter -- Animal Detected --> QueueVolunteer[Queue for Volunteer Review]

    QueueVolunteer --> AssignVolunteer[Distribute to Volunteer]
    AssignVolunteer --> CollectVote[Submit Classification]
    CollectVote --> CheckVoteCount{Sufficient Votes Reached?}

    CheckVoteCount -- No --> QueueVolunteer
    CheckVoteCount -- Yes --> EvaluateConsensus{Consensus Threshold Met?}

    EvaluateConsensus -- Yes --> PublishConsensus[(Published Scientific Dataset)]
    EvaluateConsensus -- No --> RouteExpert[Escalate to Expert Panel]

    RouteExpert --> ExpertReview{Expert Evaluation}
    ExpertReview -- Conclusive Identification --> PublishExpert[(Published Scientific Dataset)]
    ExpertReview -- Needs Additional Context --> RequestEvidence[Request Additional Frame Sequences]
    RequestEvidence --> RouteExpert
    ExpertReview -- Insufficient Details --> MarkUnknown[(Archived as Unidentifiable)]
